        "attribution": "The listed investigators made distinct major contributions to engineered T-cell concepts and clinical realization.",
        "maturity": "Approved therapies and extended clinical experience establish the principle, despite important limitations.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Efficacy remains uneven across cancers, particularly solid tumors.",
          "The field's broad technical and clinical lineage complicates restricted attribution."
